{"slug":"XMAS-Dragon-Ball:-Legendary-Forces-KI-Stat-Script-25564","_id":"67724dc62e9674fe83c832ed","title":"KI Stat Script (Works as of 4/11/2026)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78308","gameId":7446466648,"name":"[🔥UPDATE 14] Dragon Ball: Legendary Forces","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-549f54b2b34d846aebe9b34a8d318e8b-7b312d33b01d.png","placeId":7446466648},"features":"I got tired of farming KI so i made a script that's 10x faster than doing it yourself go to any area with a training multiplier and watch the numbers go up\n\n(The Script sometimes takes a few minutes to start)\n(DO NOT CHARGE KI IT WILL BREAK THE SCRIPT)","tags":["DragonballZ","Dragon","Dragon Ball","Dragon Ball Legend","Dragon Ball Legendary Forces"],"script":"local tool = game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character:FindFirstChild(\"Sphere of Destruction\") or\n             game.Players.LocalPlayer.Backpack:FindFirstChild(\"Sphere of Destruction\")\nif tool then\n    local remote = tool:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"RemoteEvent\")\n    local sound = tool:FindFirstChild(\"KameCharge\")\n\n    if remote and sound then\n        print(\"[*] RemoteEvent located. Starting continuous stat gain...\")\n\n        while true do\n            sound:Play(\"KameFire\")\n\n            remote:FireServer(\"SphereDestruction\", Vector3.new(-20212.90625, 1291.672067421875, -21308.94921875))\n            wait(0.1)\n        end\n    else\n        print(\"[!] RemoteEvent or Sound not found.\")\n    end\nelse\n    print(\"[!] Tool not found.\")\nend\n","owner":{"_id":"67541b4dab3917973b2118b7","username":"Rizukuu","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67541b4dab3917973b2118b7-1735545244452.png","status":"offline","id":"67541b4dab3917973b2118b7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":18200,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-12-30T07:37:42.240Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":2,"image":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DA